Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Abstract", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9817359575167837`*^9, 
  3.981735959218729*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"20ded6d4-1448-435b-908a-\
b51554ce1684"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here we present geometric equations of motion in the gauge group ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "61fe70a9-4e2a-4f30-a796-102d336925ac"],
 " for the inverted spherical pendulum and the axially symmetric top. The \
derivation is exactly parallel to our prior geometric equations in ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["SO",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["(3)",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"],
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox[" Gauge Theory for Classical Mechanics in ",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"],
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 ", only this time avoiding gimbal lock via better gauge choice. Both \
derivations are exceptionally concise, expressing the equations and solutions \
as geodesics on manifolds. It is remarkable that a full description of \
dynamics arises, yet again, from differential geometry alone. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981736066595272*^9, 3.981736224823421*^9}, {
   3.981736258939855*^9, 3.981736350557803*^9}, {3.98173647597398*^9, 
   3.981736552840535*^9}, {3.981736749992815*^9, 3.981736793807433*^9}, 
   3.981736850377791*^9, {3.981736883570129*^9, 3.981736922912786*^9}, {
   3.98173802777636*^9, 3.981738029004024*^9}, {3.9817382316405573`*^9, 
   3.9817382578527193`*^9}, {3.981754420175605*^9, 3.9817544385813227`*^9}, {
   3.981886000876487*^9, 3.9818860254015007`*^9}, 3.982027490278463*^9, 
   3.9820673094095383`*^9, {3.9820674027173967`*^9, 3.982067479911302*^9}, {
   3.98206752660048*^9, 3.9820675274431953`*^9}, {3.98214896999866*^9, 
   3.9821490667648697`*^9}, {3.982149097812191*^9, 
   3.982149105428705*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"03fe4a0f-27fd-4572-8ff5-\
fc64fb0129bf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We finish with a side-by-side animation showing numerical equivalence, \
aside from gimbal lock in the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6f64075d-f87f-4c80-b9a9-c5986006131a"],
 " case, which we can provoke by finding the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6b0e8553-1ed9-4dfd-9612-2e74a0545665"],
 " poles with the ",
 StyleBox["Manipulate", "Input"],
 " sliders. That is how we demonstrate superiority of the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8c642f9b-159a-4cc4-a29a-ee2dddbe331b"],
 " gauge choice over ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6c52b20-75e2-489f-af31-b46fe1950dea"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981736066595272*^9, 3.981736224823421*^9}, {
   3.981736258939855*^9, 3.981736350557803*^9}, {3.98173647597398*^9, 
   3.981736552840535*^9}, {3.981736749992815*^9, 3.981736793807433*^9}, 
   3.981736850377791*^9, {3.981736883570129*^9, 3.981736922912786*^9}, {
   3.98173802777636*^9, 3.981738029004024*^9}, {3.9817382316405573`*^9, 
   3.9817382578527193`*^9}, {3.981754420175605*^9, 3.9817544385813227`*^9}, {
   3.981886000876487*^9, 3.9818860254015007`*^9}, 3.982027490278463*^9, {
   3.982067313971283*^9, 3.9820673902981358`*^9}, {3.982067502538598*^9, 
   3.9820675154072933`*^9}, {3.9820687168613453`*^9, 3.98206873460114*^9}, {
   3.9821491362906713`*^9, 
   3.982149146441567*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7ec20749-9b11-4d3f-b2f8-\
144101b83745"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We study ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f9ca743a-b9c3-4856-904b-df60c82f23fb"],
 " here in an intuitive setting of classical mechanics so that we will be \
better equipped for transition to quantum physics. Instead of studying two \
abstractions at once in the quantum setting\[LongDash]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "21985fd8-6d73-48ea-a977-c8877bcb5769"],
 " and spinors\[LongDash]we will have only spinors to study. This notebook \
contains a full chapter on the theory of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "00bcc179-2ed8-4a66-9376-6ca935cdc848"],
 ", requiring only basic University mathematics, to further lower barriers to \
understanding. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981412216666863*^9, 3.981412269618526*^9}, {
   3.981624063234953*^9, 3.981624067294095*^9}, {3.981624242430065*^9, 
   3.981624315955064*^9}, {3.981736369967972*^9, 3.981736380661071*^9}, {
   3.981736570142117*^9, 3.981736610611462*^9}, 3.9817367312265987`*^9, {
   3.981737226896624*^9, 3.9817372286094017`*^9}, {3.981754483613678*^9, 
   3.9817544847796803`*^9}, {3.982067747814801*^9, 3.982067798226186*^9}, {
   3.98214917460223*^9, 
   3.982149256838231*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c67b7f60-7d9c-4efb-b224-\
06aa13c1ecb7"]
}, Open  ]],

