   3.981448040426124*^9}, {3.981448074195056*^9, 3.9814480965997047`*^9}, {
   3.981503868310671*^9, 3.9815038983855333`*^9}, {3.981504067060104*^9, 
   3.98150407764701*^9}, {3.981553186807729*^9, 
   3.981553187472501*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0a5dc712-b416-4279-bcf1-\
913699383159"],

Cell["\<\
In the equations of motion, we model the baton as one of these vectors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9816436669077253`*^9, 3.9816437477875557`*^9}, {
  3.9816584008964157`*^9, 3.981658432912292*^9}, {3.981658469500064*^9, 
  3.981658474911927*^9}, {3.9817283898840227`*^9, 3.9817284003962317`*^9}, {
  3.981750169530589*^9, 3.981750176763392*^9}, {3.982150419188792*^9, 
  3.982150435853714*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"37454631-0f7f-4ebe-bcec-\
71d39f998b9c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Manifolds, Curves, Tangents, Geodesics, Trajectories", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98156162239038*^9, 
  3.981561659917552*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"823cd556-c1b0-4b71-9292-\
da91680606ab"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5ecd7e00-0d27-4d21-be8e-326d45bf3631"],
 ", like any Lie group, is also a differentiable manifold. We can set up \
parameterized curves, derive tangent vectors, calculate geodesics, and so on. \
That is how we model dynamics of the pendulum and top: as trajectories of \
rotations in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "64efee75-a108-4834-b129-84fc72ee456e"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98144629682533*^9, 3.981446574010125*^9}, {
   3.98144731211971*^9, 3.981447351220468*^9}, {3.9814481441690607`*^9, 
   3.981448154711055*^9}, {3.981553337794506*^9, 3.981553365627429*^9}, {
   3.981643607363428*^9, 3.9816436353943777`*^9}, {3.981658457452717*^9, 
   3.9816584591373653`*^9}, 3.981658522701877*^9, {3.981750188293947*^9, 
   3.981750206000101*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"49855130-de6f-4638-b925-\
93e0e4bd6318"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b78c81e4-ca8d-44c2-a0fe-bedc53713694"],
 StyleBox[", the set of 3\[Times]3 real, orthogonal matrices with unit \
determinant,",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["is also a Lie Group, but, as we have seen in ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["SO(3) Gauge Theory",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://community.wolfram.com/groups/-/m/t/3647724"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 StyleBox[", it is impossible to guarantee that a trajectory in ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "500be701-3fb9-45d1-a638-6efbac6d7f74"],
 StyleBox[" will not gimbal-lock, i.e., ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "32af4f67-8c24-404b-8f27-118868e4be17"],
 StyleBox[" cannot be covered by one non-singular chart.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Subitem",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981293512311339*^9, 3.98129363548799*^9}, {
  3.981293947930201*^9, 3.981294001790509*^9}, {3.9812953964816628`*^9, 
  3.981295419577673*^9}, {3.981295465129278*^9, 3.981295484084504*^9}, {
  3.981305792991992*^9, 3.981305871527793*^9}, {3.981410763980641*^9, 
  3.981410827547719*^9}, {3.9814110737438993`*^9, 3.981411073744588*^9}, {
  3.981412991785277*^9, 3.981413008386305*^9}, {3.981447374111392*^9, 
  3.981447563721349*^9}, {3.981448186949481*^9, 3.981448189896085*^9}, {
  3.9814554963279057`*^9, 3.9814555240053587`*^9}, {3.9817502534550323`*^9, 
  3.981750281243689*^9}, {3.982150477623992*^9, 
  3.98215047777352*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d0e96836-6d34-419a-9edb-\
f35bca6d826d"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Lie Algebra ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", "(", "2", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"42dbc42a-40e9-4807-bece-d99e6bdc1288"]
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.981301684485655*^9, {3.981728374036084*^9, 
   3.981728376922021*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"77720b24-0566-4da8-ad85-\
7422dd97c99b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "DEFINITION: The ",
 StyleBox["Lie algebra",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "243169d7-7ec2-4b2e-9214-1182fb3a75fd"],
 " is the unique tangent space ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["T", 
     SubscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "2"]], "S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7b8e383b-4d22-431d-b62b-d5dfe3d84066"],
 ", at the identity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "de4e17bc-9a41-4b7d-a2a7-33a427483a12"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ab78525a-4ff8-49f5-9642-d88f09bb8068"],
 ". It contains tangent vectors to curves in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5319ac7c-29c9-4d95-a3f9-7d1434a10e23"],
 ", transported by group multiplication within ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d8ff8fff-6af6-4366-8321-4f486ca2d6d5"],
 " back to the origin of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "10616a03-81c5-45a5-bd62-0185e5035eff"],
 ".",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{" ", 
    RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"a98daaec-17af-41b0-9cb9-adba849e4b95"],
 " is thus a vector space. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981305938824493*^9, 3.981306133071661*^9}, 
   3.981413135145657*^9, {3.981413245169737*^9, 3.981413299090169*^9}, 
   3.9814135399343843`*^9, {3.9814139227848473`*^9, 3.98141400660915*^9}, {
   3.981448239448217*^9, 3.981448242631638*^9}, {3.9814486163370037`*^9, 
   3.981448630073255*^9}, {3.981455540718659*^9, 3.9814555551713867`*^9}, {
   3.9815032810309963`*^9, 3.9815033158421907`*^9}, {3.9815035251182117`*^9, 
   3.981503527615492*^9}, {3.981553425564456*^9, 3.981553429788686*^9}, {
   3.98156168536451*^9, 3.98156171798494*^9}, {3.9816245557448606`*^9, 
   3.981624676227528*^9}, {3.981658542474827*^9, 3.9816585456001873`*^9}, {
   3.9817502921312933`*^9, 
   3.981750303735692*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a98ea16e-ab0f-4b23-8368-\
c67e817848a2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3980c40c-1962-42d2-b160-dfb599d1ab76"],
 StyleBox[" is trivially a group under vector addition, but that fact is \
uninteresting. The primary ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["dynamical operation ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["in ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8977573b-74ce-4562-94a6-0f4801244aee"],
 StyleBox[" is the Lie Bracket, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"[", 
     RowBox[{"A", ",", "B"}], "]"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"A", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "B"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"B", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "A"}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"a72c55d4-8f58-404e-94a5-21bda297062c"],
 StyleBox[", a model of the ordinary cross product",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9e38d08f-4a1d-4a00-be27-dbd5349662b8"],
 StyleBox[" is ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["not a group",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox[" under this operation because there is no identity and no inverse",
  
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " ",
 StyleBox["(TODO: elaborate).",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9815041887047567`*^9, 3.981504281770228*^9}, {
  3.9815045828354187`*^9, 3.981504597526093*^9}, {3.981505123237708*^9, 
  3.981505200205935*^9}, {3.981553504916486*^9, 3.9815535293812838`*^9}, {
  3.9816247012176027`*^9, 3.981624701403077*^9}, {3.981624745646475*^9, 
  3.9816247805803328`*^9}, {3.981750373038031*^9, 
  3.981750397383259*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"333fa79a-cf05-4ecf-bc3a-\
7e0f4e9633f4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2fa51de2-c29b-433a-b089-6191b4bc10e6"],
 " is also the set of all ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "025a6869-2271-4a75-acc4-fd066899c751"],
 " complex, traceless, anti-Hermitian ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"A", "\[ConjugateTranspose]"}], "=", 
     RowBox[{"-", "A"}]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7ef0e9f0-6914-4b19-aa9f-a0b1db041ceb"],
 " matrices. The following four propositions prove this fact:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9814156560086184`*^9, 3.981415685978943*^9}, {
   3.9814157671186037`*^9, 3.981415776829097*^9}, {3.98141749362359*^9, 
   3.981417493959095*^9}, {3.981448209694285*^9, 3.9814482765730963`*^9}, 
   3.981448555632606*^9, {3.981448654925661*^9, 3.98144870134776*^9}, {
   3.981455576778872*^9, 3.981455586169345*^9}, {3.981503329741683*^9, 
   3.98150333096476*^9}, 
   3.982150565414847*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f4c16f6a-0454-4124-93c9-\
dcacaf00ff69"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every element of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[GothicS]\[GothicU]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "48b1d7a9-8d36-4e9f-80cf-09e1a767f8cc"],
 " is of the form ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox["Q", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], "(", "t", ")"}], ".", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Q", "(", "t", ")"}], "\[ConjugateTranspose]"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"87977f0b-d4f1-47c0-93f0-a495c221f3ed"],
 ", where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Q", "(", "t", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ea34dfc7-f61e-412e-9455-5b70140fc859"],
 " is a smooth curve in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "U", 
    RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cb55f3b3-f5db-4c4f-8aec-0416923ec98e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox["Q", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], "(", "t", ")"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"c273dc3e-a168-45e5-b83b-034572468b4b"],
 " is tangent to the curve at the point ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Q", "(", "t", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06b627df-9ba6-4980-94e4-8cb83e163e10"],
 "."
}], "ItemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.981448279482623*^9, {3.9814483761652737`*^9, 3.981448432183806*^9}, {
   3.981503343031242*^9, 3.981503362974202*^9}, {3.981503443727202*^9, 
   3.981503466904009*^9}, {3.981561785029688*^9, 3.981561814514624*^9}, {
   3.982150577490458*^9, 
   3.98215057749164*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2a1ea884-dd48-4e6e-a3fc-\
afe12a58af76"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["IMPORTANT",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.98, 0.56, 0.17]],
 ": This identification of elements as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox["Q", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], "(", "t", ")"}], ".", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Q", "(", "t", ")"}], "\[ConjugateTranspose]"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"cb6c55ce-ac34-4dd6-a4d5-332a602c3371"],
 " is conventional and presupposes the inertial \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]space \
frame\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for mechanics. This convention is convenient \
and standard for the proofs presented in this chapter, but not for \
computation, where we go to the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]body frame\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in the following chapters, and elements are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Q", "(", "t", ")"}], "\[ConjugateTranspose]"}], ".", 
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox["Q", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], "(", "t", ")"}]}], 
   TraditionalForm]], "ItemNumbered",ExpressionUUID->
  "406c0d14-4b7d-4343-89f0-f0f635092b0f"],
 "."
}], "SubitemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.981448279482623*^9, {3.9814483761652737`*^9, 3.981448432183806*^9}, {
   3.981503343031242*^9, 3.981503362974202*^9}, {3.981503443727202*^9, 
   3.981503466904009*^9}, {3.981561785029688*^9, 3.981561814514624*^9}, {
   3.982150583142931*^9, 3.982150766924417*^9}, {3.9821508029128*^9, 
   3.982150825091298*^9}, {3.982154715983128*^9, 3.982154734472637*^9}, {
   3.982154771806481*^9, 
   3.982154775119137*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8e701454-2997-4326-b92f-\
1e3535c69edb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Unitarity of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"U", "(", "2", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "44688cc1-5a43-42de-b811-792acb13bc94"],
 " implies that elements of ",
