  3.9817556991449747`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d98413a5-01ec-4242-b65c-\
966fb4382654"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "from the Z\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]projection of the baton; ",
 StyleBox["PotentialScalarFieldFromMetricIndexer", "Input"],
 " also implicitly injects explicit time dependence, just as with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2a17b0c3-00a7-4afe-a681-d943b0d7ed47"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981755043092327*^9, 3.9817550658800898`*^9}, {
